// EXPECT: pass
// raise 侧的两种实参形态：`++` 串联（设计稿 §6 规范写法）与逗号分隔（fault 批次 B4a）
//
// ⚠ conformance 只做 `tc check`、不运行程序 ⇒ 本例证明的是「两种形态都能过 sema 并完成
//   脱糖」；**运行期**行为（tag 值、槽位索引）由 examples/faultraise_demo 的 golden 钉住。

struct User {
    age: i64;
    name: string;
}

fault UserErr over User {
    .{ .age < 0 }   -> UserErr.AgeNegative repairs { .use_default, .clamp };
    .{ .name = "" } -> UserErr.NameEmpty    repairs { .anon };
}

// 形态一：`++` 串联
fn raise_pp(u : User) fault(UserErr)!User {
    if (u.age < 0) {
        return Err(
            @clause(.fault, .{ .age < 0 }, UserErr.AgeNegative)
         ++ @clause(.repair, .use_default, fn () User { return u; })
         ++ @clause(.repair, .clamp, fn () User { return u; })
        );
    }
    return Ok(u);
}

// 形态二：逗号分隔实参
fn raise_comma(u : User) fault(UserErr)!User {
    if (u.name == "") {
        return Err(
            @clause(.fault, .{ .name = "" }, UserErr.NameEmpty),
            @clause(.repair, .anon, fn () User { return u; })
        );
    }
    return Ok(u);
}

fn main_fn() i32 @main {
    var a : fault(UserErr)!User = raise_pp(User{ .age = -1i64, .name = "x" });
    var b : fault(UserErr)!User = raise_comma(User{ .age = 2i64, .name = "" });
    var c : fault(UserErr)!User = raise_pp(User{ .age = 5i64, .name = "y" });
    println(i2s(a.tag));
    println(i2s(b.tag));
    println(i2s(c.tag));
    return 0;
}
